{"seq":2,"slug":"gradient-interpolation","title":"渐变插值空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/advanced/gradient-interpolation","wordCount":1179,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"渐变插值空间\">渐变插值空间</h1><p>写一个从蓝到黄的 <code>linear-gradient</code>，默认结果中段会塌出一道脏兮兮的灰——很多人以为这是浏览器 bug 或显示器问题，其实它是数学上的必然。问题不在两端的颜色，而在浏览器走哪条路径从一端过渡到另一端，也就是<strong>插值空间</strong>的选择。同一对端点，在 sRGB 里插值会穿过发灰的中段，在 OKLCH 里插值会绕开灰区走明亮的弧线。渐变、<code>color-mix()</code>、CSS 过渡动画本质都是同一个插值问题。本篇讲清为什么 sRGB 插值发灰、<code>&lt;color-interpolation-method&gt;</code> 怎么选、以及色相方向的坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-插值是在空间里走直线\">核心概念：插值是在空间里走直线</h2><p>颜色插值就是在某个色彩空间里，从端点 A 到端点 B 连一条线段，按位置取中间点。关键洞察是：<strong>同样两个端点，在不同空间里连线，经过的中间颜色完全不同</strong>，因为各空间的几何不一样。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[端点 蓝 与 黄] --&gt; B[在 sRGB 空间连线]&#10;  A --&gt; C[在 oklab/oklch 连线]&#10;  B --&gt; D[直线穿过原点附近&lt;br/&gt;低彩度区]&#10;  C --&gt; E[弧线绕开灰区&lt;br/&gt;保持彩度]&#10;  D --&gt; F[中段发灰发暗&lt;br/&gt;dirty mid-tone]&#10;  E --&gt; G[中段明亮饱和]&#10;  F --&gt; H[默认 sRGB 的锅]&#10;  G --&gt; I[感知空间的优势]\">flowchart TD\n  A[端点 蓝 与 黄] --&gt; B[在 sRGB 空间连线]\n  A --&gt; C[在 oklab/oklch 连线]\n  B --&gt; D[直线穿过原点附近&lt;br/&gt;低彩度区]\n  C --&gt; E[弧线绕开灰区&lt;br/&gt;保持彩度]\n  D --&gt; F[中段发灰发暗&lt;br/&gt;dirty mid-tone]\n  E --&gt; G[中段明亮饱和]\n  F --&gt; H[默认 sRGB 的锅]\n  G --&gt; I[感知空间的优势]</pre><p>为什么 sRGB 连线会塌进灰区？因为在 sRGB 几何里，蓝和黄是近似互补的方向，二者连线会逼近彩度极低的中性轴，加上 sRGB 不感知均匀、又在 gamma 编码值上插值，中段就既灰又暗。感知空间没有这个几何缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"color-interpolation-method-选空间与色相方向\">color-interpolation-method：选空间与色相方向</h2><p>CSS 用 <code>&lt;color-interpolation-method&gt;</code> 语法显式指定插值空间，写在渐变函数里 <code>in &lt;space&gt;</code> 处。它对所有插值场景生效——渐变、<code>color-mix()</code>（见 <a href=\"../css-color/color-mix-relative\">color-mix 与相对色</a>）、未来的颜色过渡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".bad {&#10;  background: linear-gradient(to right, blue, yellow);&#10;} /* 默认 sRGB，中段灰 */&#10;.good {&#10;  background: linear-gradient(in oklch, blue, yellow);&#10;} /* 绕开灰区 */&#10;.lab {&#10;  background: linear-gradient(in oklab, blue, yellow);&#10;} /* 直角感知空间 */&#10;.hue {&#10;  background: linear-gradient(in oklch longer hue, red, red);&#10;} /* 走整圈色相环 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.bad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">to</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">yellow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 默认 sRGB，中段灰 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.good</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oklch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">yellow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 绕开灰区 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.lab</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oklab, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">yellow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 直角感知空间 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.hue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oklch longer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">hue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 走整圈色相环 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>空间分两类。直角空间（<code>srgb</code>、<code>srgb-linear</code>、<code>oklab</code>、<code>lab</code>、<code>display-p3</code>、<code>rec2020</code>、<code>xyz</code> 等）按三个直角坐标线性插值。极坐标空间（<code>hsl</code>、<code>hwb</code>、<code>lch</code>、<code>oklch</code>）的色相 <code>H</code> 是角度，需要额外指定走哪个方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色相插值方向-四个关键字\">色相插值方向：四个关键字</h2><p>极坐标空间插值色相时，从角度 A 到角度 B 有两条弧（顺时针、逆时针），CSS 提供四个方向关键字精确控制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键字</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>shorter hue</code></td>\n<td>走较短的弧（默认）</td>\n<td>相近色相的自然过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>longer hue</code></td>\n<td>走较长的弧</td>\n<td>故意横扫一大段色相</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>increasing hue</code></td>\n<td>沿角度递增方向</td>\n<td>彩虹环正向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>decreasing hue</code></td>\n<td>沿角度递减方向</td>\n<td>彩虹环反向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经典坑：<code>oklch</code> 从红（约 30°）到青（约 195°），<code>shorter hue</code> 走 30°→195° 经黄绿，<code>longer hue</code> 走另一侧经品红——选错就过渡出你没想要的颜色。当两端色相相同（如 <code>red</code> 到 <code>red</code>）想做整圈彩虹，必须显式 <code>longer hue</code>，否则短弧距离为 0 不动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"srgb-linear-另一个减少发灰的选择\">srgb-linear：另一个减少发灰的选择</h2><p>除了换感知空间，还有一个常被忽视的选项：<code>in srgb-linear</code>。它仍在 sRGB 三角形里，但先把 gamma 编码值解码到线性光再插值（线性光的非线性定义见 <a href=\"../foundations/color-models-spaces\">色彩模型与空间</a>）。这能消除&quot;在编码值上平均导致偏暗&quot;的那部分问题，让中段亮度更准，尤其适合需要物理正确混光的场景（如模拟透明叠加）。但它不解决&quot;穿过低彩度中性轴&quot;的几何问题，所以对互补色渐变，感知空间 <code>oklch</code>/<code>oklab</code> 仍是更优解。</p>\n<p>数学上，正确的线性插值要求先解码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、线性混合、再编码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{out} = f\\!\\left( (1-t)\\, f^{-1}(C_A) + t\\, f^{-1}(C_B) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是 sRGB 传递函数。直接在编码值上算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-t)C_A + t C_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 省掉了这步，就是默认渐变发暗的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><p>经验法则：UI 渐变和状态色过渡默认用 <code>in oklch</code>（绕开灰区、感知均匀、彩度饱满）；需要色相平滑横扫的彩虹/光谱效果用 <code>oklch</code> 配合 <code>longer hue</code>/<code>increasing hue</code>；模拟真实光混合（如半透明叠层、发光）用 <code>srgb-linear</code>。浏览器支持上，OKLCH 渐变自 Safari 16.2、Chrome 111、Firefox 113 起可用（据 MDN 与 CSS 插值资料），2026 年已无顾虑。把插值空间当作渐变的必填项而非默认值，是从&quot;会写渐变&quot;到&quot;写对渐变&quot;的分界——这也直接影响设计系统里色阶与渐变 token 的质量，见 <a href=\"../practice/color-in-design-systems\">设计系统中的色彩</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>颜色插值是在某空间里连端点的线段，同样端点在不同空间经过的中间色完全不同。</li>\n<li>sRGB 默认插值对互补色会穿过低彩度中性轴、又在 gamma 值上平均，导致中段发灰发暗。</li>\n<li><code>in &lt;space&gt;</code> 选插值空间：<code>oklch</code>/<code>oklab</code> 绕开灰区、感知均匀，是 UI 渐变首选。</li>\n<li>极坐标空间用 <code>shorter/longer/increasing/decreasing hue</code> 控制色相走哪条弧，选错会过渡出意外色相。</li>\n<li><code>srgb-linear</code> 解决 gamma 发暗但不解决几何穿灰；真实光混合用它，互补渐变仍用感知空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../css-color/oklch-perceptual\">OKLCH 与感知均匀</a> 解释感知空间的几何优势；<a href=\"../css-color/color-mix-relative\">color-mix 与相对色</a> 是同一插值问题的混色形态。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../web-animation/javascript-animation/css-vs-js-division\">Web 动画 — CSS 与 JS 动画分工</a> 涉及颜色过渡作为动画属性的处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渐变插值空间","id":"渐变插值空间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：插值是在空间里走直线","id":"核心概念-插值是在空间里走直线"},{"level":2,"text":"color-interpolation-method：选空间与色相方向","id":"color-interpolation-method-选空间与色相方向"},{"level":2,"text":"色相插值方向：四个关键字","id":"色相插值方向-四个关键字"},{"level":2,"text":"srgb-linear：另一个减少发灰的选择","id":"srgb-linear-另一个减少发灰的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"网页 HDR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/advanced/hdr-web"},"next":{"title":"浏览器色彩管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/advanced/color-management-pipeline"}}